<title>CANADA: Petro-Canada raises posted oil prices.</title>
<headline>Petro-Canada raises posted oil prices.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petro-Canada said it raised the price it would pay for some grades of crude oil by C$4.00/cubic metre or C$0.64/barrel, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The new prices were listed as follows:</p>
<p>Edmonton light sweet C$181.00/cubic metre, or C$28.78/barrel</p>
<p>Cromer light sour C$172.00/cubic metre, or C$27.45/barrel</p>
<p>Hardisty medium C$146.00/cubic metre, or C$23.21/barrel</p>
<p>((Reuters Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624))</p>
</text>
